  "notes": "{振|ふ}る is a godan verb meaning to wave, shake, or sprinkle.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{振|ふ}る\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{振|ふ}る: to wave (one's hand)\n- ⟦{首|くび}→首：00792_kubi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{振|ふ}る: to shake one's head (disagreement)\n- ⟦{尻尾|しっぽ}→しっぽ：09089_shippo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{振|ふ}る: to wag one's tail\n- ⟦{塩|しお}→塩：00887_shio⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{振|ふ}る: to sprinkle salt\n- ⟦サイコロ→サイコロ：06524_saikoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{振|ふ}る: to roll dice\n- ⟦{振|ふ}り{向|む}く→振り向く：04232_furimuku⟧: to turn around\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {振|ふ}る: to wave, shake (transitive)\n- ⟦{降|ふ}る→降る：00839_furu⟧: to fall (rain/snow) (intransitive)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{振動|しんどう}→振動：08179_shindou⟧: vibration\n- ⟦{振替|ふりかえ}→振替：15942_furikae⟧: transfer, exchange",
